@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### T01 View all issues -> 200 + JSON array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/issues

### T02 Create a valid issue -> 201 + complete created issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer unavailable",
  "description": "The shared printer is not responding.",
  "priority": "Medium"
}

### T03 Create with a missing title -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing valid title",
  "priority": "Medium"
}

### T04 Create with an invalid priority -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Projector flickering",
  "description": "The projector in room B204 flickers.",
  "priority": "Critical"
}

### T05 Change the status of an existing issue -> 200 + status Resolved
# Replace the id with one returned by T01 or T02.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/issues/ISS-101/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Resolved"
}

### T06 Change to a status that is not allowed -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/issues/ISS-101/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Deleted"
}

### T07 Update an unknown issue -> 404 ISSUE_NOT_FOUND
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/issues/does-not-exist/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Resolved"
}

### T09 Create while sending server-owned fields -> 201, client values ignored
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "HACKED-1",
  "title": "Projector flickering",
  "description": "The projector in room B204 flickers.",
  "priority": "Low",
  "status": "Resolved",
  "createdAt": "2000-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### T10 Create without JSON -> 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: text/plain

title=Printer

### T11 Create with malformed JSON (trailing comma) -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer unavailable",
  "description": "The shared printer is not responding.",
  "priority": "Medium",
}

### T12 Unknown route -> 404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/fake-url
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Lab 5: health check -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Lab 7: count issues -> 200 + { "count": n }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/issues/count
